      "description": "Whether this dashboard can see. Discarded OpenTelemetry entries counted by the exporter itself, by signal and reason, plus attribute omissions. The queue-depth series this panel once carried is gone on purpose: agentsfleet_otlp_queue_depth has no producer — the software development kit owns the export queue and exposes no depth — and a target for it drew an empty line that read as health. The UNPRODUCED ledger in rustd/crates/afd_observability/src/metrics/produced.rs names it, and names this counter as the surviving local-loss signal. An empty panel here means nothing was dropped."
